sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Authenticated Shopper
    participant UI as Order MFE (:3002)
    participant GW as API Gateway (:8080)
    participant OS as Order Service (:8083)
    participant PS as Product Service (:8082)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL (order_db)
    participant KF as Kafka Broker (:9092)

    User->>UI: Click "Confirm & Pay"
    UI->>GW: POST /api/orders/checkout (Authorization: Bearer JWT)
    GW->>GW: Validate JWT Signature & Claims
    GW->>OS: Forward with headers X-User-Id, X-User-Email
    OS->>OS: Server-Side Price Recalculation
    OS->>PS: POST /api/products/{id}/decrement-stock
    PS->>PS: Execute Atomic UPDATE WHERE stock >= quantity
    PS-->>OS: 200 OK (Stock Reserved)
    OS->>DB: INSERT INTO orders (status='PLACED') & order_items
    DB-->>OS: Order #79 Persisted
    OS->>KF: kafkaTemplate.send("order-events", orderId, OrderEvent)
    KF-->>OS: Producer Ack (acks=all)
    OS-->>GW: 201 Created (OrderDTO)
    GW-->>UI: 201 Created (Order Confirmation Details)
    UI-->>User: Display Success Screen with Order #79
